          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo nawe yaataaha owe Gibea, yaagyenda n'omutwe gw'amamanzi, abu MUKAMA yaakozire aha mutima, bamushendekyereize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
